STARTED pack-two pid 30
SHOT pack-two-startup
USE CLIENTS 'USE CLIENTS\r\n. '
INDEX ON NAME TO BYNAME 'INDEX ON NAME TO BYNAME\r\n. '
INDEX ON BAL TO BYBAL 'INDEX ON BAL TO BYBAL\r\n. '
SET INDEX TO BYNAME,BYBAL 'SET INDEX TO BYNAME,BYBAL\r\n. '
SET ORDER TO 1 'SET ORDER TO 1\r\n. '
PACK 'PACK\r\n. '
